# Build artefacts from `cargo build` (invoked by ./build.sh). This
# crate is NOT part of the main cmux-linux workspace, so its
# target/ dir is sibling to mux/target/ rather than nested under
# it. Keep it out of git per the cmux-linux AGENTS.md rule "Never
# commit .tools/, mux/target/, .venv/, or anything in .gitignore".
target/

# Cargo.lock for an example plugin is unnecessary churn (no
# reproducible builds needed for the example; the source alone
# determines the artifact when build.sh is re-run). Skip it.
Cargo.lock

# Editor scratch.
*.swp
*.swo
